# Workers Static Assets applies this file natively, before any asset or the
# Worker is matched.
#
# A trailing slash would otherwise get Cloudflare's default 307 to the slashless
# page: a TEMPORARY redirect, so a link somebody posts with a slash never hands
# its signal to the canonical URL. One rule per path depth, because a
# placeholder matches exactly one segment; `/` itself matches none of them.
# The deepest route is /<lang>/<page> — add a line if that ever grows.

/:a/ /:a 301
/:a/:b/ /:a/:b 301
/:a/:b/:c/ /:a/:b/:c 301
